## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing
1. Delete `outlook_account` from config.json
2. Launch app → Should auto-detect email and populate dropdowns
3. Verify folder dropdowns have values
4. Restart app → Should reconnect automatically using saved account

### Edge Cases
- No Outlook installed → Should show warning in console, not crash
- Multiple Outlook accounts → Uses first account (can be overridden manually)
- Outlook not running → COM should start it automatically
